  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Reviewing App Structure**\n\nI\'m currently reviewing `src/App.tsx` to assemble the application based on the specified section order. The first section I\'m tackling is the HEADER/NAVBAR. I\'m focusing on the logo, which I\'ll represent with a minimalist icon and \"LogiFlow\" text. Following that, I\'ll be implementing the institutional links: \"Como funciona,\" \"Simula\303\247\303\243o de frete,\" and \"Para transport.\"\n\n\n**Developing Hero Section**\n\nNow I\'m diving into the hero section design. My focus is the left side, crafting a compelling title and subtitle, alongside prominent CTAs. The title will be strong and the subtitle concise. I\'m also preparing for the visual layout, anticipating the right-side mockup, imagining an elegant real-time freight comparison demonstration.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_593597"
      name: "create_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Content\":\"import React, { useState } from \'react\';\\nimport { Navbar } from \'./components/Navbar\';\\nimport { Hero } from \'./components/Hero\';\\nimport { HowItWorks } from \'./components/HowItWorks\';\\nimport { FreightSimulator } from \'./components/FreightSimulator\';\\nimport { PartnershipSection } from \'./components/PartnershipSection\';\\nimport { Footer } from \'./components/Footer\';\\nimport { Modals } from \'./components/Modals\';\\nimport { QuoteOption } from \'./types\';\\n\\nexport default function App() {\\n  const [loginOpen, setLoginOpen] = useState(false);\\n  const [registerOpen, setRegisterOpen] = useState(false);\\n  const [selectedQuote, setSelectedQuote] = useState<QuoteOption | null>(null);\\n\\n  const handleScrollToSimulator = () => {\\n    const el = document.getElementById(\'simulador-frete\');\\n    if (el) {\\n      el.scrollIntoView({ behavior: \'smooth\' });\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleScrollToHowItWorks = () => {\\n    const el = document.getElementById(\'como-funciona\');\\n    if (el) {\\n      el.scrollIntoView({ behavior: \'smooth\' });\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleScrollToPartnership = () => {\\n    const el = document.getElementById(\'parcerias\');\\n    if (el) {\\n      el.scrollIntoView({ behavior: \'smooth\' });\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"min-h-screen bg-zinc-950 text-zinc-100 selection:bg-emerald-500/30 selection:text-emerald-300 font-sans flex flex-col antialiased\\\">\\n      {/* 1. HEADER / NAVBAR */}\\n      <Navbar\\n        onOpenLogin={() => setLoginOpen(true)}\\n        onOpenRegister={() => setRegisterOpen(true)}\\n        onScrollToSimulator={handleScrollToSimulator}\\n        onScrollToHowItWorks={handleScrollToHowItWorks}\\n        onScrollToPartnership={handleScrollToPartnership}\\n      />\\n\\n      <main className=\\\"flex-1\\\">\\n        {/* 2. HERO SECTION */}\\n        <Hero\\n          onScrollToSimulator={handleScrollToSimulator}\\n          onOpenRegister={() => setRegisterOpen(true)}\\n        />\\n\\n        {/* 3. STORYTELLING: \\\"COMO FUNCIONA O FLUXO\\\" (3 PASSOS) */}\\n        <HowItWorks />\\n\\n        {/* 4. WIDGET INTERATIVO: SIMULADOR DE FRETE (CENTRAL) */}\\n        <FreightSimulator\\n          onSelectQuote={(quote) => setSelectedQuote(quote)}\\n        />\\n\\n        {/* 5. SE\303\207\303\203O DE PARCERIA: PARA TRANSPORTADORAS E EMBARCADORES */}\\n        <PartnershipSection\\n          onOpenRegister={() => setRegisterOpen(true)}\\n        />\\n      </main>\\n\\n      {/* 6. FOOTER INSTITUCIONAL */}\\n      <Footer\\n        onOpenLogin={() => setLoginOpen(true)}\\n        onOpenRegister={() => setRegisterOpen(true)}\\n        onScrollToSimulator={handleScrollToSimulator}\\n        onScrollToHowItWorks={handleScrollToHowItWorks}\\n        onScrollToPartnership={handleScrollToPartnership}\\n      />\\n\\n      {/* MODALS: /login, /register, and Freight Contract */}\\n      <Modals\\n        loginOpen={loginOpen}\\n        onCloseLogin={() => setLoginOpen(false)}\\n        registerOpen={registerOpen}\\n        onCloseRegister={() => setRegisterOpen(false)}\\n        selectedQuote={selectedQuote}\\n        onCloseQuoteModal={() => setSelectedQuote(null)}\\n        onOpenRegisterFromLogin={() => setRegisterOpen(true)}\\n      />\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n}\\n\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/App.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating App.tsx with refactored architecture\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update App component\"}"
      thought_signature: ""
      original_name: "create_file"
    }
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 2
      nanos: 290312816
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
